 Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"nePr9450kf-eEGYD-Qn21w","review_id":"neL3WDtGfYUtX4c6dGvE5g","date":"2018-11-20T22:27:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.939997673034668,"text_excerpt":"We came here for their Veuve Clicquot brunch and had such a great time. The restaurant was decorated so festively with bright orange and yellow flowers and they were giving out some swag if you ordered the Veuve. Shamefully this was my first time trying Ruby Slipper but I'm glad we checked it out. Normally I have a hard time at breakfast places because I don't eat eggs, but I felt like there were a number of things on the menu that I wanted to try. I ended up with the Costa Rican breakfast (eggs on the side for my husband) and was not disappointed. If you DO like eggs they have tons and tons of delicious options. My husband had a hard time narrowing it down to one. Also the candied bacon ..."},{"business_id":"nePr9450kf-eEGYD-Qn21w","review_id":"lzGWtJSq4kXi3ZqOtUg6ow","date":"2021-04-17T21:01:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9390830993652344,"text_excerpt":"This restaurant is very popular in Nola especially for brunch so I suggest go early if you're coming with a group. The line might be long but its so worth it. You can also go on Yelp or their website and \"join the waitlist\". Its a good tool because by the time you walk or uber there, your table is pretty much ready. I started with Bacon Infused Vodka Bloody Mary. Dam! This was so good. I could tell the mix was made fresh. As far as food, I got the The Trifecta which was basically 3 kinds of egg benedicts. Eggs Cochon (Slow-cooked, apple-braised pork), Chicken St. Charles (fried chicken) and Bayou Shrimp Benedicts. The portion was huge but I devoured the entire thing cause it was simply de..."},{"business_id":"nePr9450kf-eEGYD-Qn21w","review_id":"r2zWsV0K7BN21vVkPV4nxg","date":"2018-01-06T19:22:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385532736778259,"text_excerpt":"This place had THE BEST eggs Benedict I've ever had. I got \"The Trifecta\" which features their shrimp eggs Benedict, chicken eggs Benedict, and the pork eggs Benedict. The chicken was definitely the best and honestly to die for, with the pork being a close second. It's a must try! The shrimp I could've done without, but there was nothing wrong with it! Just not of my taste for brunch. We also ate a BYO omelet which was pretty good! We loaded it up with every kind of meat which was good, but just a little too much for me. That was my friends order.. lol. The potatoes that came with it were crunchy and good too! To finish we had the stuffed French toast! They were featuring salted caramel a..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"nePr9450kf-eEGYD-Qn21w","photo_id":"P0o5V7Lkc-oY6zGVmKB54w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/P0o5V7Lkc-oY6zGVmKB54w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8723708987236023},{"business_id":"nePr9450kf-eEGYD-Qn21w","photo_id":"M9TwGqJ9Xq3R7j6oP4iVoA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/M9TwGqJ9Xq3R7j6oP4iVoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8436307907104492},{"business_id":"nePr9450kf-eEGYD-Qn21w","photo_